name memoirchapterstyles
category Package
revision 59766
shortdesc Chapter styles in memoir class
longdesc A showcase of chapter styles available to users of memoir: the
longdesc six provided in the class itself, plus many from elsewhere (by
longdesc the present author and others). The package's resources apply
longdesc only to memoir, but the package draws from a number of sources
longdesc relating to standard classes, including the fncychap package,
longdesc and Vincent Zoonekynd's tutorial on headings.
